# Runtime failures

## A Datastar button does nothing

Check four boundaries:

1. The page includes the staged `/assets/datastar.js` module.
2. The attribute is a Rocci action (`@post("/path")`) or an explicitly quoted Datastar expression.
3. The handler route and HTTP method match (`--log-handlers`).
4. The returned fragment reuses an `id` already in the document.

Row-specific URLs must be Roc expressions. A static quoted string does not
interpolate a `@for` binder.

## `/page` returns 308 or 404

With `redirect_trailing_slash = true`, GET 308s between `/page` and `/page/`.
When false, the wrong form is 404 with a hint. Rocci preserves registered
route shape.

## HTTP 500 from a handler

`?` in a handler is a 500. Datastar gets an HTML overlay; other clients get
`{"error":"…"}`. `@init` failure exits the process instead.


## Worker builds and requests

Run `rocci worker build` directly to see source-mapped compiler errors. A
failed custom build preserves the last `.rocci/worker/` tree. In dev mode an
unchanged failure is memoized to prevent watch loops; edit an input or run the
build directly to retry. Output/source-map/ABI hashes are in `manifest.json`.
`--locked` errors require reviewing toolchain changes, then regenerating the
lock deliberately. `--offline` errors name the missing cache dependency.

Worker editor diagnostics require a first successful build or an explicit
`ROCCI_WORKER_ROC` path to the qualified compiler. Restart the language server
after changing compiler settings. A missing OS hosted symbol means the effect
is outside the managed capability profile. Use the native runtime or change
the explicitly unsupported effect. SQL aliases must exactly match
`worker.sqlite.path` or `aliases`; there is no filesystem fallback. Use unique
SQL result aliases and explicit bounded `Http.send_with!` options. A 503 means
a queue/resource bound or an unsettled old continuation; retry the read after
the indicated delay. Do not automatically retry a mutation whose response was
lost. Durable SQL and reconstructed context determine its actual outcome.

Generated hosting attributes logs and traps to the authored init/route/live
declaration (`file:line`). Plain Roc falls back to its entry location. The
source-map artifact handles compile diagnostics; optimized Wasm instruction
addresses are not reconstructed as individual Roc expressions.
